; @polis/react (dev/optional peer) still pins @mantine/core ^7||^8 upstream,
; while this theme has moved to Mantine v9. Until @polis/react ships its v9 bump,
; tolerate the transitive peer conflict so `npm install` (and CI type-check/lint)
; can resolve. Safe here: @polis/react is an optional peer used only for types.
legacy-peer-deps=true
